## Keep the review current

When the desk provides new data, reconcile by report ID, inspect changed copies rather than
silently overwriting conflicting evidence, and read the report bodies before assigning a cause.
Apply this classifier only to the scheduling failure modes it actually models, not every product
handled by the desk. New mechanisms need their own investigation and ticket.

Recompute the coverage, reconcile every unique report exactly once, update the GitHub issues,
and rebuild both the source page and rendered copy. Keep unresolved symptoms visible until
their fixes are reproduced. Do not claim a live update from a static import.

